OL,3,GNEWSAEverton applies to double event
OL,4,Alimit at stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FPremier League club Everton has applied
OL,7,Fto double the annual limit on concerts
OL,8,Fand other non-sporting events at its
OL,9,Fnew stadium in Liverpool.
OL,11,FThe existing planning condition allows
OL,12,Ffour non-football events to take place
OL,13,Fat full capacity each year, including
OL,14,Fconcerts and other sports.
OL,16,FEverton wants Liverpool City Council to
OL,17,Fallow eight full-capacity non-sporting
OL,18,Fevents, with rugby and other sporting
OL,19,Ffixtures no longer counting towards the
OL,20,Flimit.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
