OL,3,GNEWSAEverton applies to double event
OL,4,Alimit at stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo decision on the application has been
OL,7,Fmade at this stage. Everton's planning
OL,8,Fagent said current restrictions were
OL,9,Fpreventing the stadium from hosting
OL,10,Ffurther events, despite interest from
OL,11,Fpromoters.
